# Golden mirror byte stream, protocol v1 (docs/specs/usb-mirror.md). Worked out by hand, not generated.
# Read by test/test_mirror (the firmware's encoder must produce it) and mirror/mirror.test.mjs (the page must
# decode it). In order:
#   info 320x240
#   rect x=10 y=20 w=30 h=40 color=0xF800
#   power on
#   rect x=-5 y=0 w=1 h=1 color=0x07E0
#   the log text "Hi\n" between frames
#   rect x=319 y=239 w=1 h=1 color=0xFFFF
A5 49 05 01 40 01 F0 00 FC
A5 52 0A 0A 00 14 00 1E 00 28 00 00 F8 88
A5 50 01 01 50
A5 52 0A FB FF 00 00 01 00 01 00 E0 07 BB
48 69 0A
A5 52 0A 3F 01 EF 00 01 00 01 00 FF FF 89
